IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
77 STANDALONE PIC X(5) VALUE "FIVE5".
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
